WEBVTT

00:38:28.636 --> 00:38:31.476
with the Russian defense minister

00:38:31.476 --> 00:38:36.556
engaging in deconfliction
measures with UN

00:38:36.556 --> 00:38:38.676
offices being invited to Moscow.

00:38:38.676 --> 00:38:40.756
So as bad as it is right now,

00:38:40.796 --> 00:38:43.436
people that have been
doing this for a long time

00:38:43.476 --> 00:38:45.756
are trying to avoid nuclear war.

00:38:45.796 --> 00:38:47.196
But that's the point.

00:38:47.196 --> 00:38:49.756
Is we're now in a situation

00:38:49.756 --> 00:38:52.996
where the conflict
that we're going to experience

00:38:53.036 --> 00:38:55.636
needs to be actively managed

00:38:55.676 --> 00:38:58.996
because of the danger
of nuclear confrontation.

00:38:59.036 --> 00:39:04.916
So it now becomes a risk on the horizon
that we must be continually aware of,